{"795510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Koihime Enbu RyoRaiRai", "steam_appid": 795510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [840070, 1603560], "detailed_description": "Set against the tumultuous backdrop of ancient China's Three Kingdoms era, Koihime Enbu RyoRaiRai delivers fast-paced fighting action featuring an all-female cast of warlords. Engage in intense battles for kingdom supremacy, personal glory, and beyond.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/795510/extras/d6c76ad5552c5cefc142d0544a4f09f8.avif?t=1729702207\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>Koihime Enbu RyoRaiRai represents the pinnacle of extensive arcade game updates, meticulously rebalanced to align even more closely with the original vision: a fighter that's accessible to all.<br><br>Whether you're a genre veteran or a newcomer, this game has something for you. Veterans will appreciate the streamlined controls that let them dive right into the action, while newcomers can hone their skills through training and challenge modes, preparing them for both online and offline battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/795510/extras/98c510ee5fdd0d0fc7c37e4c52331e0d.avif?t=1729702207\" width=600 height=224 /></span><br><br>The Hougeki (Fatal Counter) system allows players the freedom to cook up their own combos, mixing ingredients like EX Special Attacks, Ougi and Hiougi: the cookbook is yours to command! With the freedom to add the spice of your choice to the mix with a selection of strategists (“assist” characters), this series update expands on the already winning recipe. <br>So get ready for the kind of epic battles you'd expect when warlords of ancient China clash!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati